{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.poster.avif?t=1753742231\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.webm?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.mp4?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up! You're a Sketchy Driver now in this rogue-lite high speed, no brakes/no rules driving game! Just pure, high-speed chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through traffic, risk everything, launch off ramps, and pull off ridiculous mid-air tricks. All to chase that sweet, sweet high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.poster.avif?t=1753742231\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.webm?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.mp4?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Think you\u2019re a bad driver? Your friends definitely do. Suck at racing games? Perfect. This is your chance to flip the script (and  the car). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.poster.avif?t=1753742231\" width=740 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.webm?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.mp4?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless rogue-lite driving game where the only direction is forward, and fast. Try not to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.poster.avif?t=1753742231\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.webm?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.mp4?t=1753742231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544870?t=1753742231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/5400ad7502c9f9c4e52d3c05d35186a8fc51afd6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753742231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/60ac9d25265432c18b3eb65a74b432b52666de9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753742231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544870/60ac9d25265432c18b3eb65a74b432b52666de9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753742231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Famil